      <name>Cours Sadi Carnot</name>
      <description>ref: D 932
name: Cours Sadi Carnot
oneway: yes
highway: secondary
old_ref: N 132
surface: asphalt
maxspeed: 30
description: On this one-way street the cycle lane is on the left, not on the right, the reverse of what is expected for France. Attention! It finishes at Rue Dotezac, before the roundabout, so be prepared to resume the normal side of the road before then.
cycleway:left: lane
description_1: However, staying in the left lane may be preferable if you are turning south onto the cycleway towards Roaillan.
name:etymology:wikidata: Q215778</description>
